# hyprstate power policy: base state -> profile (see POWER_SPEC.md in the
# hyprstate repo). Profiles: power-saver | balanced | performance.
# Manual override: `hyprstate power set <profile>` or click the waybar widget;
# overrides auto-clear when the AC state changes.
# battery* keys are inert on machines without a battery.
#@ docked-ac = balanced
#@ ac = balanced
#@ battery = power-saver
#@ battery-low = power-saver
#@ battery-low-percent = 15
{{- if eq .system.hostname "mason-air" }}
# mason-air: no lid grace. hyprstate's lid route always holds a 30 s
# countdown and, as of 2.7.4, reads hypr-DE's "Inhibited sleep" hypridle log
# line as a live idle inhibitor, so every lid close lands in DEFERRED and
# the laptop never sleeps. Declaring the lid absent drops hyprstate's
# handle-lid-switch inhibitor and lets logind suspend on close immediately
# (hypridle's before_sleep_cmd still locks first). Revisit once hyprstate
# grows a lid-grace key.
#@ lid = absent
{{- end }}
